==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 92 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between August 26th (11:00am) and September 9th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
During {{Color|#FF0000|'''Friday, Saturday, and Sunday,'''}} {{Color|#0000FF|'''units can be levelled up for 1/2 of their normal cost!'''}}<br>
※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Half-Off Energy Cost for Empire, Future and Cosmos stages!'''}}<br>
During this event, the Cat Energy cost to challenge stages in the {{Color|#34A853|'''Empire of Cats,'''}} {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Into the Future,'''}} or {{Color|#0000FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} will be half the normal cost each day during the times below!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am ~ 8:59am / 12:00pm ~ 1:59pm / 7:00pm ~ 8:59pm'''}}

※ This Cat Energy cost reduction does not apply to Zombie Outbreak stages.<br>
※ If the Cat Energy reduction does not appear at the listed times above, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Super Catfruit Festival!'''}}<br>
Each day, a new {{Color|#46BDC6|'''Catfruit map'''}} will be available according to the schedule below! {{Color|#0000FF|'''Saturdays and Sundays'''}} will have all 5 colors available!<br>
Monday: {{Color|#0000FF|'''Growing Blue'''}}''',''' {{Color|#FF9900|'''Growing Yellow'''}}''',''' {{Color|#34A853|'''Growing Green'''}}<br>
Tuesday:{{Color|#FF9900|''' Growing Yellow'''}}''',''' {{Color|#34A853|'''Growing Green'''}}''',''' {{Color|#9900FF|'''Growing Purple'''}}<br>
Wednesday: {{Color|#34A853|'''Growing Green'''}}''',''' {{Color|#9900FF|'''Growing Purple'''}}''',''' {{Color|#FF0000|'''Growing Red'''}}<br>
Thursday: {{Color|#9900FF|'''Growing Purple'''}}''',''' {{Color|#FF0000|'''Growing Red'''}}''',''' {{Color|#0000FF|'''Growing Blue'''}}<br>
Friday: {{Color|#FF0000|'''Growing Red'''}}''',''' {{Color|#0000FF|'''Growing Blue'''}}''',''' {{Color|#FF9900|'''Growing Yellow'''}}

Now is your chance to collect a huge amount of Catfruit and power up your Cat Army further!<br>
※ Catfruit stages are available after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#38761D|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00CCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''8/27, 8/30, 9/2, 9/5, 9/8, 9/11 and 9/14!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Builder's Blitz!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage to collect building materials needed for a better Cat Base! Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during the times below to put your Cat Army to the test in the special stages {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings'''}}{{Color|#4285F4|''','''}} and {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Island of Ash!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00am～8:59am / 12:00pm～1:59pm / 6:00pm～7:59pm / 10:00pm～11:59pm'''}}

Take on this challenge each day and stockpile building materials!

※These stages will become available once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared.<br>
※ The Cavern of Comets, Strait of Wings, and Island of Ash stages will appear at regularly scheduled times in addition to the special campaign times listed above.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign! Check in and profit!

